    "title": "PropTech and the Pursuit of Operational Alpha in Multifamily Portfolios",
    "excerpt": "Deconstructing real estate returns into Market Beta versus Operational Alpha: how automated cloud infrastructure compresses operating expense ratios by 400 basis points.",
    "author": "Julian Thorne, Principal Real Estate Systems Strategist",
