    "excerpt": "Legal and regulatory analysis of Title VIII of the Civil Rights Act: how landlords can maintain rigorous tenant underwriting standards while adhering to HUD guidance on disparate impact.",
    "author": "Julian Thorne, JD, Real Estate Regulatory Counsel",
